---
id: vitaminka-cabbage-carrot-salad
title: Classic Vitaminka Cabbage Salad
category: fresh_salad_veg

yield:
  servings: 2
  cooked_g: 525

storage:
  fridge_days: 7
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Empty @coleslaw-mix{1%package} into a large mixing bowl and coarsely grate @carrots{90%g} over it.

Pour in @apple-cider-vinegar{1.5%tbsp} and @olive-oil{2%tsp}, then season with @kosher-salt{0.6%tsp} and @black-pepper{0.25%tsp}. Toss vigorously for 1 to 2 minutes — the fresh moisture from the grated carrot helps wilt the stiffer machine-cut shreds.

Cover and rest ~rest-time{30%min} in the fridge so the liquid releases and redistributes. Toss once more and serve chilled.
